  "details": "Description\n\nwhen i try to go to a world (does not matter if its my own instance i created or somebody else's, the result is the same), the loading screen refreshes several times before crashing and sending me back to the error world. this happens no matter what world i join.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nim not sure how you would even go about trying to reproduce this bug, it started happening a few weeks ago. if i close the game and reopen it repeatedly there is a small chance that it'll actually let me go to a world, but after that the bug starts happening again\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: World\n\n- Frequency: Often\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3p2-1921-15c4a824b2-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-10-17_12-44-39.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_8dc448cb-f548-4999-92bb-e8175b2df6c5/1/file)",
